The Khronos OpenXR loader only reads the per-user active_runtime.json on Linux; on macOS
it then finds no runtime unless XR_RUNTIME_JSON is set, which NotProton's run script does not
pass to Wine. This lets macOS use the same XDG lookup (~/.config/openxr/1/active_runtime.json).
Applied to KhronosGroup/OpenXR-SDK-Source at 3ed64d0f9bb680f24b80a085091e5c8fab38f7b7.

